{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56754","headline":"秋分夜夕月乐章 降神奏元和之舞六变 · 无名氏","name":"秋分夜夕月乐章 降神奏元和之舞六变","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"月以阴德，自西而生。\n积水之气，作金之精。\n丽天成像，配日爲明。\n三光显耀，万古作成。\n（《大唐郊祀录》卷六。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"无名氏","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56754.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56754","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}